        "Content": "**RAY COOKE LETTINGS - PLEASE FOLLOW US ON FACEBOOK AND INSTAGRAM AS PROPERTIES ARE ADVERTISED THERE FIRST- VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST** \r\n\r\n******* BEAUTIFUL 2 BED / 2 BATH APARTMENT ****** 2 X DOUBLE BEDROOMS ***** FULLY FURNISHED***** SPACIOUS BALCONY WITH LEAFY VIEWS ****** AVAILABLE NOW!! \r\n\r\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this Beautiful 2 Bed / 2 Bath Apartment to the lettings market located in Belfry Hall, Citywest, D24. This very spacious Apartment comprises of an entrance hall, spacious lounge and dining area leading into a kitchen with fully fitted modern kitchen units, Spacious balcony, Two double bedrooms (One with Ensuite) spacious storage closet and main bathroom. The apartment boasts gas fired central heating, 2 x Double bedrooms with fitted wardrobes and a spacious balcony Located at the foothills of the Dublin Mountains, The Apartment is only minutes from the N7, N81 and the M50 providing ease of access to various routes. The property is tastefully decorated in neutral tones throughout and is ready for immediate occupation. The Belfry Hall development offers the best of both worlds to its residents, by virtue of its location adjacent to the thriving business community at Citywest which also includes the Citywest shopping centre. The LUAS is only a short stroll away ensuring this development is accessible to so many amenities both social and essential including Schools, the Hospital, & The Square / Citywest shopping Centres. Viewing is Highly Advised. \r\n\r\nKey Features Include: \r\nBeautiful 2 Bed / 2 Bath Apartment \r\n2 X Double Bedrooms with Fitted Wardrobes \r\nFully Furnished throughout\r\nSpacious Balcony with leafy views \r\nFully fitted modern kitchen with All Mod-Cons \r\nFully Tiled bathrooms \r\nGas central heating \r\nDouble glazed windows \r\nClose to LUAS Stop \r\nEasy access to both the N7 and M50 \r\nQuiet development\r\nUnderground Parking \r\nVarious Amenities close by \r\nAvailable Now! \r\n\r\n***RAY COOKE LETTINGS - EMAIL ENQUIRY ONLY/NO PHONE CALLS PLEASE - FILL IN YOUR CONTACT INFORMATION AND WE WILL CONTACT YOU WITH VIEWING DETAILS WHEN THEY ARISE**"
      },
